  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Upgrading of national roads in Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will boost the socio-economic development of Uganda by providing better access to social infrastructure, facilitating access to market for farmers and traders, reinforce the regional integration and tourism.

The project relates to the upgrading of Katine-Ochero (70 km), Kyenjojo (Kihura)-Bwizi-Rwamwanja-Kahunge (68km) and Mpara-Bwizi (37km) roads from gravel roads to paved one, and the construction of the Masindi Port Bridge.</narrative>
  </description>
